[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2543726395","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033#issuecomment-2543726395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033","id":2543726395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6Xni87","user":{"login":"devshgraphicsprogramming","id":6894321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTQzMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6894321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming","html_url":"https://github.com/devshgraphicsprogramming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-15T10:07:39Z","updated_at":"2024-12-15T10:07:39Z","body":"@keptsecret we usually compile with `-fspv-debug=vulkan-with-source` by default, why doesn't our ray query unit test crash as well?\n\nWe do have a significant difference that  `lib_6_x` target never worked for us much and we use `cs_`\n\n@ChristianReinbold curious question, why are you using ray-queries and RT pipeline at the same time?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2543726395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545079921","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033#issuecomment-2545079921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033","id":2545079921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6XstZx","user":{"login":"ChristianReinbold","id":32750401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzUwNDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32750401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold","html_url":"https://github.com/ChristianReinbold","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T09:42:15Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T09:42:15Z","body":"@devshgraphicsprogramming I always build my MWEs from a small snippet which used to be for the RT pipeline. I never updated the decorator and arguments though. When changing to compute shaders the problem still persists: https://godbolt.org/z/36PMMznKd\n\nDid you double-check that you compile the unit test with the flag? I did not found a configuration nor any hint in the DXC code why ray queries could work with it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545079921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545219279","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033#issuecomment-2545219279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033","id":2545219279,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6XtPbP","user":{"login":"devshgraphicsprogramming","id":6894321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTQzMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6894321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming","html_url":"https://github.com/devshgraphicsprogramming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T10:38:55Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T10:38:55Z","body":"Now we always tend to use Spir-V intrinsics because there's less problem/hassle for us than relying on the HLSL Spir-V codegen for certain \"extensions\"\n\nHere's our custom Godbolt and STL library, it works and compiles\nhttps://tinyurl.com/44fk3av7\n\nYou can clearly see\n```\nOpModuleProcessed \"dxc-cl-option:  -T cs_6_7 -E main -spirv -Zpr -enable-16bit-types -fvk-use-scalar-layout -Wno-c++11-extensions -Wno-c++1z-extensions -Wno-c++14-extensions -Wno-gnu-static-float-init -fspv-target-env=vulkan1.3 -HV 202x -fspv-debug=source -fspv-debug=tool\"\n```\n\n@keptsecret can you dig up the version that used HLSL intrinsic style RayQuery ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545219279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545222326","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033#issuecomment-2545222326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033","id":2545222326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6XtQK2","user":{"login":"devshgraphicsprogramming","id":6894321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTQzMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6894321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming","html_url":"https://github.com/devshgraphicsprogramming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T10:40:16Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T10:40:16Z","body":"@ChristianReinbold, huh `-fspv-debug=vulkan-with-source` segfaults, but `-fspv-debug=source -fspv-debug=tool` works... hmmm","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545222326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545243139","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033#issuecomment-2545243139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033","id":2545243139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6XtVQD","user":{"login":"devshgraphicsprogramming","id":6894321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTQzMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6894321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming","html_url":"https://github.com/devshgraphicsprogramming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devshgraphicsprogramming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T10:49:37Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T10:49:37Z","body":"OK, there's another similar issue https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/5113\n\nThe Non-Semantic Debug info extension was authored by the Renderdoc author, Renderdoc probably doesn't support ray-queries yet and definitely doesn't support RT pipeline shaders.\n\nBecause of the above, anything that renderdoc doesn't support/won't debug DXC probably never tested emitting `vulkan-with-source` debug info for, and even if it doesn't crash there's no telling its correct.\n\nThis leads to a question do other debuggers such as Nsight even require this extension to give you source level debug?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545243139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545393324","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033#issuecomment-2545393324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033","id":2545393324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6Xt56s","user":{"login":"ChristianReinbold","id":32750401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzUwNDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32750401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold","html_url":"https://github.com/ChristianReinbold","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T11:40:59Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T11:40:59Z","body":"#5113 seems to boil down to the same problem, just for another type missing in the switch statement.\n\nRegarding usage: NSight Graphics also claims to require the option, see [here](https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-graphics/UserGuide/index.html) (search for -fspv-debug=vulkan-with-source). This is what I am interested in.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545393324/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/comments/2545406768","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033#issuecomment-2545406768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033","id":2545406768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6Xt9Mw","user":{"login":"ChristianReinbold","id":32750401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzUwNDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32750401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristianReinbold","html_url":"https://github.com/ChristianReinbo